<title>USA: Meris Laboratories president resigns.</title>
<headline>Meris Laboratories president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meris Laboratories Inc said William Neeley had resigned as president of the company.</p>
<p>It said Henry Bose, the company's general counsel, had been appointed as acting president and chief executive officer pending the hiring of a permanent replacement.</p>
<p>The company said its board of directors had created a committee of its independent directors to find a candidate to replace Neeley, who will work for the company as a consultant and medical director.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for his resignation.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
